Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:47:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD Vim visual yanking so terminal panes support keyboard
 copy

Terminal visual mode keeps selection state inside the UI layer, works over the rendered left or right pane, and emits OSC52 clipboard data for yanks. The terminal adapters refresh the visible right-pane source before key routing so selections match what users see.
